# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# InterviewIQ frontend configuration
# Copy this file to `.env` if you need to override defaults. Vite only exposes
# variables prefixed with VITE_.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Base URL of the backend API.
# Leave unset to use the default of "/api", which the Vite dev server proxies
# to http://localhost:5000 (see vite.config.ts).
# In production, point this at your deployed API, e.g. https://api.example.com/api
VITE_API_URL=/api
